5,0,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Let's keep this efficient. I'm a simple villager, so I'll be watching your reactions closely.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,George,,I agree. Let us all remain calm and observe. I am a villager as well.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Yumi,,Hello everyone! I'm so excited to play with you all! Let's work together to find the werewolf!,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Takumi,,I'm not scared of any werewolf. I'll find the monster and take them down myself!,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,It is a pleasure to meet you all. I hope we can find a peaceful resolution to this.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Takumi, your enthusiasm is a bit loud. Try to use your brain instead of just your muscles.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,George,,"Now, now, Shunichi. Let's not start with arguments. We have plenty of time to observe.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Yumi,,"Hehe, Takumi-kun is just passionate! I think that's great! Let's all be friends!","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Shunichi, shut it! I can think just fine! I'm just ready to fight!","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Jonathan,,Quietness often reveals more than noise. I will simply listen for now.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Jonathan, a passive approach is fine, but don't be so boring that you become suspicious.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,George,,I find Jonathan's approach quite reasonable. There is no need to rush into accusations.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Yumi,,I agree with George-san! Let's just get to know each other a bit more first!,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Takumi,,"I don't need to ""get to know"" anyone. The werewolf is the one who's lying!","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Jonathan,,I understand. I will try to be more present in the conversation.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Shunichi,,Fair enough. I've seen enough for today. I'll be waiting for the Seer's results tomorrow.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,George,,I believe we have established a baseline. I am satisfied for now.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
22,0,4,pass,George,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
23,0,4,talk,Yumi,,"I'm ready for tomorrow! Goodnight everyone, sleep well!","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,Takumi,,I'm not sleeping! I'm staying awake to catch that wolf!,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
25,0,4,talk,Jonathan,,Goodnight. May your dreams be peaceful.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
