32,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Well, the first night is over. Seer, if you've found something interesting, now is the time to hint at it.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,George,,Let us see who speaks first. A sudden claim of being the Seer can be a gamble.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Yumi,,"Good morning! I hope everyone slept well! I have some information, but I'm a bit nervous...","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"@Yumi, stop being nervous and just say it! Who's the wolf?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"Please, let Yumi speak at her own pace. There is no need to rush her.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Yumi, if you're the Seer, you should be confident. Or are you just pretending to be nervous to blend in?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,George,,"Shunichi, you are being too aggressive. Yumi, please tell us what you found when you are ready.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"Thank you, George-san! I checked George-san last night, and he is definitely a human!","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"Great, so George is safe. That leaves the rest of us. @Jonathan, you've been too quiet.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""George"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,I am merely reflecting on the information. It is good to know George is trusted.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,A human result is the most boring result possible. It doesn't narrow things down much.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,George,,"It provides a foundation of trust, which is valuable. I appreciate the divination, Yumi.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Yumi,,"You're welcome! I really want us all to survive, so I'll do my best to help!","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"I don't trust this. @Shunichi, you're acting like you know something. Are you the wolf?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,Accusations without evidence can lead to unnecessary chaos. Let us be careful.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,"@Takumi, your logic is flawed. Being analytical isn't a sign of being a wolf; it's a sign of intelligence.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,George,,I suspect Takumi is letting his emotions lead him. I will vote based on who seems most disruptive.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Yumi,,"Oh no, please don't fight! I'm sure we can figure this out together if we just stay positive!","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Takumi,,"I'm not being disruptive, I'm being honest! I'm voting for the one who's trying to act too smart!","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,I believe we should consider the possibility that the wolf is hiding in plain sight.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
