65,2,1,talk,George,,"Shunichi is gone. It is a shame, but his temperament was indeed a distraction.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,2,1,talk,Yumi,,"I'm so sorry, Shunichi-san... But I have to tell you all something very important now!","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,2,1,talk,Takumi,,Finally! Tell us! Did you find the wolf last night?,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,"I am listening. Please, Yumi, share your findings with us.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,2,2,talk,George,,"Take your time, Yumi. We are all listening.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,2,2,talk,Yumi,,"I divined Takumi-kun last night... and he is the Werewolf! I'm so sorry, Takumi-kun!","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,2,2,talk,Takumi,,What?! That's a lie! I'm not the wolf! Yumi is the one lying to frame me!,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"That is a very serious revelation. Takumi, do you have a defense other than denial?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,2,3,talk,George,,"Yumi has been consistent. Takumi, your outbursts have only made you look more suspicious.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,2,3,talk,Yumi,,"I really didn't want it to be you, Takumi-kun! But the vision was so clear!","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,2,3,talk,Takumi,,She's lying! She's the Possessed or the Wolf herself! Don't listen to her!,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,It seems the evidence points in one direction. It is a sad necessity.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,2,4,talk,George,,I have seen enough. I trust Yumi's divination. It is time to end this.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,2,4,talk,Yumi,,I'm so sorry... but we have to protect the village!,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,2,4,talk,Takumi,,"You're all idiots! I'll never give up, but you're making a huge mistake!","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
80,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,"May you find peace, Takumi. We must do what is required.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
